{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d4e88eb238a86495e5104635f04d7b683bb60e2197bf84e06c4006734a3353b9", "ja": "いいんじゃないかな。\n今は考えをまとめてるみたいだし……。", "zh": "应该没问题吧。\n我看她好像正在整理思绪的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
