{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_02_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "2421da5bff8ac82f96a21e980c1129b57f8a656e4a21ee87830ef9f443e95e76", "ja": "エレナのサッカーボールでも持ってくればよかったな。\nリフティング、けっこううまくなったんだ♪", "zh": "早知道就带艾琳娜的足球来了。\n我挑球的技术进步了很多喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_02_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "d602a75f0591e870ea691d97d1ee19cbc019df21f2f58c66946319de34c7bf93", "ja": "……あれ？\nあそこにいるの、歩じゃない？", "zh": "……咦？\n那个人不是步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "34b0e55e8a64ffae7eb712eeb7a15e530dff1cceb92032ac840993c81a318533", "ja": "おおっ、確かに。\nあの目立つピンクの髪は……。", "zh": "哦哦，对耶。\n看那醒目的粉红色头发，的确是她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_02_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "db86aa7bc82a19a59bab916db73adcf2b0de981074756a4547b59e4801f3712b", "ja": "えっと、そ、その……。\nあ、あははは……。", "zh": "呃，那、那个……\n哈、哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_02_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e1ec9b664cb79ee6638d089b95f6d2df9f7827d6dcd7ad174b6b1817cd00c4ad", "ja": "マズい！　さっき「イエス！　ナイストゥミーチュ！」\nって答えたから、英語できると思われてる～！？", "zh": "糟了！因为我刚才回答「Yes! Nice to meet you!」，\n结果让对方以为我会讲英文吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0074_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_02_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "db3b96b00a6ef597384c4395a25bbbb43b47e40ec1b380b3cc27a5c0d066950b", "ja": "歩、外国の人としゃべってんの！？　すげーじゃん！\nやっぱ留学すると、英語しゃべれるようになるんだな！", "zh": "步，你在跟外国人讲话喔！？好强！\n果然只要留学，就可以学会讲英文呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
